{"title":"Thak Vanguard","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Thak Vanguard is a guard — a named <a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a> seen at level 34–39.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Thak Vanguard</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Vanguard%20Camp\">Thak Vanguard Camp</a></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Dune%20Raider%20Stronghold\">Dune Raider Stronghold</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"thak-vanguard\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-mace\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/163910b1c1e523fad89b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-arms\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dc8e655dbf47607bb61d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Thak Footmans</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/vanguard-captain-mhorsk\">Vanguard Captain Mhorsk</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/943cc0a6e8d1aa9dd0bd.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Thak Vanguard</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/thak-footman\">Thak Footman</a></td></tr><tr><th>Role</th><td>guard</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>34–39</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>185</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>23 times</td></